        <main class="terms-page">
            <div class="card">
                <h1>About UBR Esports</h1>
                <p class="meta">Building a stronger BGMI community</p>
                <p>UBR Esports is a premier grassroots esports tournament organizer and gaming community platform focused on discovering, supporting, and promoting emerging BGMI talent across India.</p>

                <h3>Our Mission</h3>
                <p>We aim to create a professional, transparent, and rewarding battle arena where young gamers and competitive rosters can showcase their skills, compete against top-tier teams, and achieve their dreams in esports.</p>

                <h3>What Sets Us Apart</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Daily Organized Scrims:</strong> High quality competitive custom lobbies with strict ping and tier verification.</li>
                    <li><strong>Instant Prize Distribution:</strong> Transparent wallet and lightning-fast withdrawal systems via UPI.</li>
                    <li><strong>Zero Tolerance for Cheating:</strong> Anti-cheat marshals reviewing every tournament game.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Why Choose UBR Esports?</h3>
                <p>We believe every gamer deserves a stage. Whether you are an underdog squad looking for recognition or a seasoned clan aiming for the championship, UBR Esports provides the platform to level up your game.</p>
            </div>
        </main>

